---
import MediaImage from "./MediaImage.astro";
---

<section class="section">
  <div class="container split split--2 reverse reveal" data-reveal>
    <div class="media-frame aspect-landscape">
      <MediaImage
        src="/placeholders/serbian-roots.svg"
        alt="Placeholder for an editorial visual about Serbian breeding roots"
        width={1600}
        height={1000}
      />
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Serbian roots, Chicago home</p>
      <h2>Family experience, carried into a Chicago home.</h2>
      <p>
        The family and partner connected to Angel Bulldogs have extensive French Bulldog
        breeding experience in Serbia. That same family connection is part of Bella’s original
        breeding story.
      </p>
      <p>
        We now bring that experience into a small home environment in Chicago. Angel Bulldogs
        is a Chicago-based program—not a long-running U.S. kennel under this name, but a
        family continuation of work that began in Serbia.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
